    "note": "As introduced (134th GA); no later version read. Quoted lead-ins to divisions (C)(1) and (D)(1) are followed in the bill by conditions (transfer through a dealer, law enforcement agency, or listed exception) not quoted here for length. Also amends R.C. 2929.28 (fines for the new offence) and 5122.311."
